{
  "_comment": [
    "Merge base for the vanilla layouts this mod overrides.",
    "",
    "upstream/ holds a pure vanilla copy of each file as it stood at the recorded game",
    "build. panorama/layout/ holds our hand-merged copy. A three-way merge is:",
    "  ours        = panorama/layout/<file>.xml",
    "  base        = upstream/<file>.xml",
    "  theirs      = the file as it exists in the NEW game build",
    "",
    "If a file in upstream/ no longer matches the game, refresh it BEFORE merging, or",
    "the diff will show the game's own changes as ours and produce a silent revert.",
    "Run tools/extract_vanilla.py first, then confirm by hand.",
    "",
    "recordedBuild was the buildid from appmanifest_1422450.acf at the time these were",
    "taken. Note that on 2026-10-08 that build had a pending update",
    "(TargetBuildID 25789635, BytesToDownload 45616352), so treat the pending flag as",
    "meaning 'update the game, then re-check'."
  ],
